From eb1ea00e2b66bdeb5ccaae1ba9b92b0ef17f103d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] ARM: configs: gts28ltexx: enable Landlock

pacman's download sandbox needs it: without it pacman stops with "Landlock
is not supported by the kernel" and nothing can be installed on the device.
Landlock is the only LSM enabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
index d42856ce2..7d882cc0c 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
@@ -301,3 +301,9 @@ CONFIG_GPIO_ARIZONA=m
 CONFIG_DMADEVICES=y
 CONFIG_PL330_DMA=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_SAMSUNG_GTS28_WM1814=m
+
+# pacman's download sandbox restricts itself with Landlock, and refuses to run
+# without it. Landlock alone: this kernel has no other LSM.
+CONFIG_SECURITY=y
+CONFIG_SECURITY_LANDLOCK=y
+CONFIG_LSM="landlock"
